    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "the code — one place temperature enters",
      "lane": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "That's the chapter's actual function. Temperature enters the arithmetic in one place: it divides the score differences. No question goes in, no answer key, no evidence. And zero is rejected outright — low temperature here isn't a secret 'pick the best' mode.",
